> On Fri, 31 Jan 2020 09:31:04 -0800, Ramalingam C wrote:
> >
> > Since on new discrete GPUs we dont have the mappable aperture, if that
> > is acceptable for the test purpose, we should use GEM_MMAP_OFFSET.
